I was listening to Grieg's "In the Hall of the Mountain King" the
other day and thought this would make a neat special room in Nethack
(much like a treasure zoo.) The inspiration comes from Scandinavian
mythology and, more specifically, the play Peer Gynt, where the hero
finds himself surrounded by trolls and giants in a hall below the
mountain.

The room (called the "Hall of the Mountain King") would have a set
chance of appearing on any level (below a certain depth), and would
only appear once in any game. It would be filled with trolls and
giants, each sitting on a heap of treasure (gems, gold, and/or
jewelry.) There would of course be an opulent throne in the middle,
with the Mountain King (a really big, really nasty troll) sitting on
it. And at least one Olog-hai somewhere in the room, to make it really
tough (like a dragon in an opulent throne room.) Maybe a chance of a
magic lamp, to make all the fighting worth it?
Needless to say, this would be quite a challenge, especially if you
have the aggravate monster intrinsic, because the trolls will just
keep resurrecting from the dead. You won't have time to get rid of
them by eating them, as soon as you're done fighting one troll another
one will come along. A nice hungry pet would be a real help here...

Level sounds could include:
"You feel the earth shake below your feet."
"You hear the roar of mighty voices."

Any more suggestions?

